      <h2 class="project__intro__opening">Who Owns Your Miles?</h2>
      <p class="project__intro__body">
        Ride data has a way of getting stuck. Log a few thousand miles in one
        app and that’s where they stay. The Distance puts activities on the
        Atmosphere instead, the same open network as Bluesky. Same maps and
        stats. Eventually. Your data goes where you go.
      </p>
